# Copy to 'allowlist.txt' (git-ignored) to RESTRICT which targets the harness
# will run against — one IP or hostname per line. '#' starts a comment.
# If this file (and HARNESS_ALLOWLIST) are absent, any validated target is
# allowed (unchanged behaviour). When present, the target must match exactly.
#
# Example:
# 10.10.10.5
# dc01.lab.local
